# Per-suite scratch state. The suites write enrollment records, spent invite
# signatures and OAuth pairing sessions into these; none of it belongs in a
# commit. Matched by SHAPE rather than by listing each name, because the
# previous list-of-names approach silently missed __relay_auth_test_state_*__
# the moment a new suite was added — the file showed up untracked in `git
# status` and was one `git add -A` away from being committed.
__*__.json
__*__*.json

